00:36:41,500 --> 00:36:42,533
It breaks my heart.

712
00:36:42,599 --> 00:36:45,599
Listen, it irritates me and I do get a little bit fired up about it, but

713
00:36:45,599 --> 00:36:47,933
it breaks my heart more when someone says, well, I got my own thing.

714
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:48,900
going with God.

715
00:36:48,949 --> 00:36:49,550
No, you don't.

716
00:36:49,616 --> 00:36:50,933
How arrogant are you?

717
00:36:52,050 --> 00:36:56,566
You telling me that God has a plan for everybody else, but yours is different?

718
00:36:56,633 --> 00:36:58,300
Listen, bro, I've only been talking to you for 2 minutes.

719
00:36:58,366 --> 00:36:58,900
that ain't true.

720
00:36:59,849 --> 00:37:01,199
You are not that guy.

721
00:37:01,900 --> 00:37:03,766
By the way, there are no guys like that.

722
00:37:03,833 --> 00:37:05,500
There are no women like that.

723
00:37:05,566 --> 00:37:07,183
There's no one like that.

724
00:37:07,316 --> 00:37:10,066
Jesus said, hey, I am the way, the truth, and the life.

725
00:37:10,133 --> 00:37:13,433
No man coming to the Father except through him.

726
00:37:13,666 --> 00:37:15,766
You don't get to change that.

727
00:37:17,150 --> 00:37:18,466
So what is your life built on?

728
00:37:20,050 --> 00:37:23,933
Have you built it upon pride or Jesus Christ and Nazareth who lived, died, and rose again?

729
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:26,216
So that we could be saved from our sin?

730
00:37:27,949 --> 00:37:30,416
Once again, how does one become elected by grace?

731
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:33,050
What a great question.

732
00:37:33,116 --> 00:37:34,433
How does one become the elect?

733
00:37:35,599 --> 00:37:37,433
How does one become part of the remnant?

734
00:37:39,449 --> 00:37:40,550
By grace through faith.

735
00:37:43,616 --> 00:37:44,866
God will never cast away.

736
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:48,300
Those who come to him by faith.

737
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,733
So what Hezbound eyes closed over this place.
